; 4_voice_get_ready — SSG envelope-driven voice approx: "GET READY!"
;
; Q  = envelope period (smaller = faster swept attack/decay)
; E  = envelope shape (writing it retriggers the envelope — every E
;      directive is the start of a new "syllable")
;        $0 = single decay (sharp attack, fade)
;        $E = bidirectional triangle (vibrato-like)
;
; Each syllable: pick consonant preset (noise burst) + retrigger
; envelope + run a short pitch sweep for vowel formant.

T220
V14
O5
L64

Q30 E0
P3 D E F+
P0 G G+ A A G F+ E
R64

Q40 E0
P3 E F+
P0 G A A+ B B B B A+ A G F+
R64

Q24 E0
P3 D D
P0 E F+ F E D D D
R64

Q50 E0
P0 G A B > C C
~
